## Commands and conversations

<!--
One subsection per feature: a user story, the commands and buttons involved, the exact
conversation (what the user sends, what the bot answers), acceptance criteria and edge cases
(wrong input, /cancel in the middle, pressing an old button, the bot restarted mid-conversation).
Example:

### Notes
- As a user I can keep short notes and delete them.
- /add <text> saves a note (1–500 characters); a bare /add asks for the text; /cancel stops.
- /notes lists my notes newest first with a ✕ button per note; deleting edits the list.
- Acceptance: other users never see my notes; at most 20 notes per user.
-->

